  "description": "Change of use from B1 (offices) to C2 (residential institution).  Removal of an existing detached shed and its replacement with a greenhouse.  Associated hard and soft landscaping, the provision of a cycle store and a bin store and both external and internal alterations.\r\n\r\n.",
