  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (GH-SK01, GH-02380/2/ATree SurveyLocation PlanPlanning StatementSchedule of Listed building worksSustainability ReportTransport StatementTravel Plan Received 07/01/2011Amended GH-03, GH-04, GH-05Received 15/03/2011)  therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The use shall be restricted to that of a C2 residential institution for a yoga retreat centre, and no other use within the C2 use class.",
    "Condition : 4 - Classes for the use hereby permitted for C2  purposes shall not be carried on outside the following times 06.30-20.30 .",
    "Condition : 5 - The maximum combined number of staff and students on site shall not exceed 16 people at any given time.",
    "Condition : 6 - The travel plan submitted with the application shall be implemented as approved prior to the occupation of the site.",
    "Condition : 7 - No construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority."
